+Subject: cve-2018-0732
+
+DH key generation accepted any prime size, so a DHE server sending a huge p
+could make the client spend a very long time in DH_generate_key().
+generate_key() now rejects p above OPENSSL_DH_MAX_MODULUS_BITS (the check
+compute_key() already had). Fixed in 1.0.2p (2018-08), after the last 1.0.1
+release.
