+with EXFLAG_INVALID_POLICY is reported to the verify callback, with an
+internal-error guard. Ported to 1.0.1u's int-return convention (ret==-1);
+existing X509_F_CHECK_POLICY/ERR_R_INTERNAL_ERROR, no new macros.
