+certificate could cost hundreds of MiB on a plain TLS handshake. The name is
+now built just in time during CRL matching and freed after the comparison.
+kktls port: the name is built by a static helper in x509_vfy.c (no new
+exported symbol); DIST_POINT_set_dpname() and the public structs unchanged.
