+From: Android (KitKat external/openssl patches/tls12_digests.patch), ported to OpenSSL 1.0.1u for android-kitkat-tls12
+Subject: tls12_digests
+
+Adapted: 1.0.1u SSL_set_SSL_CTX copies the negotiated CERT_PKEY digests into the
+new CERT; with the digests in s->s3 that copy goes (they survive the CERT swap).
+Jelly Bean 4.1/4.2 base: the SSL3_STATE hunk without the Channel ID fields as
+context (no channelid patch there); same change.
+---
+diff --git a/ssl/s3_clnt.c b/ssl/s3_clnt.c
